ves in the same house as i do  went to answer the door and there was a  jab from a newspaper respectable  broadsheet which i won't mention  by name who said is it true that david  ambrose did  and she said not as far as i know  it wasn't he wasn't five minutes ago  so david attenborough thank you very  much for joining us  still very much alive you can listen to  the full  interview in our podcast the economist  asks  every week we talk to a high profile  figure click the link opposite  to find this episode and thanks for  watching

